# OQ-7, L §6.1 The joint model's own movements: booked in a member's place "only where same or fulfils links it to the
# member's own movement". help (300.00 PLN on 2026-03-15) is stated same as a.gift and as b.gift_in_m, which agree
# with it at a.konto and at b.konto (L §6.1 What same does: "a place two of them book ... takes it at the point of the
# last of them", once): b.konto 200 + 300 = 500.00 (kb, kb0); a.konto 500 + 12 x 1 000 - 300 = 12 200.00 at the year's
# end (ka), 4 200.00 on 2026-04-30 (ka0). Nothing is left out.
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "0b0615a67a4ae71646df39a5edbd8b0a4fe46b72c4f53654cfa7eaa10b6a9a81"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "4f927bb0b7b8b6a1acfc3c6b41ae7af8e9f8b78b4e5a331024f351ac66548a01"

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input jday: date
input jamt: money PLN

move help: transfers
  on jday
  leg cash from a.konto to b.konto amount jamt

version jv
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 2026-01-02
  jday = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  same help = a.gift
  same help = b.gift_in_m
  jamt = 300.00 PLN "plan"

ask kb: bal(b.konto, 2026-12-31)
ask kb0: bal(b.konto, 2026-04-30)
ask ka: bal(a.konto, 2026-12-31)
ask ka0: bal(a.konto, 2026-04-30)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place to_ben: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input pay_dom: int
input gift_amt: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move wage[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt

move gift: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from konto to to_ben amount gift_amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  wage_amt = 1 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  pay_dom = 10 "umowa"
  gift_amt = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== ben.tally
model ben
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place from_ana: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input gift_in: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move gift_in_m: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from from_ana to konto amount gift_in

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  gift_in = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 200.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== expect kb kb0 ka ka0
kb: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
kb0: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
ka: 12 200.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
ka0: 4 200.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
